<title>SWEDEN: Kinnevik to close ZTV-Danmark in Nov.</title>
<headline>Kinnevik to close ZTV-Danmark in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish media Kinnevik said on Monday its Modern Times Group division would close its Danish television station ZTV-Danmark on November 30.</p>
<p>&quot;As a part of our work to bring greater focus and efficiency to the Modern Times Group, the operations of ZTV-Danmark will cease on November 30,&quot; Kinnevik said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a substantial cost saving,&quot; Pelle Tornberg, president of Modern Times group said.</p>
<p>--Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
